# Guest of Hauteur with a Replica Maul and a full inventory: Steel Bones' 57 for the Replica Maul (the other side of the
# Maul check), then 58 with no room for the Targe: not completed, the letter kept; once there is room 58 completes it.
char zone=PortBastok pos=-150,-7.48,19 job=WHM lvl=31
item ReplicaMaul
quest Bastok.WelcomeToBastok completed
quest Bastok.GuestOfHauteur accepted
login
equip ReplicaMaul Main
trigger Steel_Bones            # the Replica Maul, no letter: 57
finish                         # the Letter from Domien
fill-inventory
trigger Powhatan               # the letter held: 58
finish                         # the inventory full: not completed, the letter kept
free-inventory
trigger Powhatan               # 58 again
finish                         # completed: Targe, fame +30, the letter deleted
